<section class="home-why" id="why-us" aria-labelledby="home-why-title">
    <div class="home-studio-watermark home-why__watermark" aria-hidden="true"><span>Почему мы</span><span>Мы</span></div>
    <div class="home-section-heading">
        <h2 id="home-why-title">Работаем как часть<br><span>вашей команды</span></h2>
        <div class="home-section-note">
            <img class="home-section-note__corners" src="/img/home-why-corners.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
            <p>Не продаём отдельные часы специалистов.<br>Собираем под задачу продуктовую команду<br>и ведём проект от первой гипотезы до запуска</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-why__cards">
        {{#each whyPoints}}
        <article class="home-why-card{{#if variant}} home-why-card--{{variant}}{{/if}}">
            <span class="home-why-card__number" aria-hidden="true">{{number}}</span>
            <div class="home-why-card__copy">
                <h3>{{#if lines}}{{#each lines}}<span>{{this}}</span>{{/each}}{{else}}{{title}}{{/if}}</h3>
                <p>{{description}}</p>
            </div>
        </article>
        {{/each}}
    </div>
</section>
